so nothing can actually fire — which is exactly why this leaked in the live
playground: the trigger reads live (enabled, pointer cursor, full opacity),
opens, and offers a menu of dead controls with nothing saying why.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

